     migration now and drop it after a bake period. Either of those is a different change than the one you asked for.
  2. [1mHas non-repo code stopped referencing it?[0m An app still issuing [38;5;153mINSERT INTO users (..., notes)[39m or [38;5;153mSELECT notes[39m
     breaks at the moment the deploy job runs, not at merge time.

  If the answer to both is "yes, go ahead" — data is disposable, no live readers — say so and I'll write
  [38;5;153mmigrations/003_drop_notes.sql[39m with just the [38;5;153mALTER TABLE users DROP COLUMN notes;[39m and update [38;5;153mschema.sql[39m to match.
